<template name="loginPrivacy">
  <view class="card"><view class="heading">隐私政策</view><text class="hint">生效日期：2026-11-15　本政策适用于「众墅之家」小程序及配套服务（运营主体：湖北众墅之家展陈设计有限公司，下称"我们"）。</text></view>
  <view wx:if="{{showAgreement}}" class="card"><button class="row" data-view="agreement" bindtap="go"><image class="row-icon" src="/pages/account/assets/account-agreement.jpg" mode="aspectFit"/><text class="grow">用户协议</text><text class="arrow">›</text></button></view>
  <view class="card"><view class="heading">一、我们收集的信息</view><text class="body-text">1. 登录信息：账号标识、登录安全信息及微信登录授权信息；密码只用于校验，不以明文保存。</text><text class="body-text">2. 个人资料：微信头像与昵称、姓名、所属公司与岗位（由所在公司管理员指派维护）。</text><text class="body-text">3. 业务素材：你在办理业务中上传的照片与文件（如头像、现场照片、往来凭据等）。</text><text class="body-text">4. 使用信息：设备信息、操作日志，用于保障服务安全与排查故障。</text></view>
  <view class="card"><view class="heading">二、我们如何使用信息</view><text class="body-text">上述信息仅用于：账号验证与岗位身份识别、业务办理与消息通知、内容安全审核、服务运行维护。我们不会将你的个人信息用于上述目的之外的场景。</text></view>
  <view class="card"><view class="heading">三、信息的共享与存储</view><text class="body-text">我们委托腾讯云提供短信验证码、对象存储（存储于中国境内）与内容安全审核服务，仅共享完成对应功能所必需的信息。除法律法规要求或你的明确同意外，我们不向其他第三方提供你的个人信息。</text></view>
  <view class="card"><view class="heading">四、你的权利</view><text class="body-text">你可以在"我的"页面查看、更正个人资料；可以联系所在公司管理员更正公司与岗位信息；可以通过"账号与隐私 → 注销账号"申请注销账号。注销后我们将依法删除或匿名化你的个人信息（法律法规要求留存的业务记录除外）。</text></view>
  <view class="card"><view class="heading">五、联系我们</view><text class="body-text">如对本政策有任何疑问、意见或投诉，请联系：peihr85@gmail.com / 18897911681。我们将在 15 个工作日内答复。</text></view>
</template>
<template name="loginAgreement">
  <view class="card"><view class="heading">用户协议</view><text class="hint">生效日期：2026-11-15　本协议是你与湖北众墅之家展陈设计有限公司（下称"我们"）之间就使用「众墅之家」小程序服务所订立的协议。</text></view>
  <view class="card"><view class="heading">一、服务说明</view><text class="body-text">本服务面向企业内部协作：员工账号由所在公司管理员开通并指派岗位，你按被授予的岗位权限使用客户、工程、财务、内容等工作台功能。</text></view>
  <view class="card"><view class="heading">二、账号与安全</view><text class="body-text">账号仅限本人使用，请妥善保管登录凭证，不得转借。人员离职或调岗时，由管理员通过系统完成岗位交接与权限回收。</text></view>
  <view class="card"><view class="heading">三、用户行为规范</view><text class="body-text">你承诺不上传违法违规、侵犯他人权益的内容；上传的素材将经过内容安全审核。你在工作中录入的业务数据应真实、准确。</text></view>
  <view class="card"><view class="heading">四、数据归属</view><text class="body-text">你在服务中形成的客户、项目、财务等业务数据归你所在公司所有；我们按法律法规及与公司的约定进行存储与保护。</text></view>
  <view class="card"><view class="heading">五、服务变更与免责</view><text class="body-text">我们可能因系统维护、升级等原因暂停服务，并将提前通知。因不可抗力或非我们过错造成的损失，我们不承担责任。</text></view>
  <view class="card"><view class="heading">六、协议更新与联系我们</view><text class="body-text">我们可能适时修订本协议并在应用内公示，协议更新后会在登录时提示你重新阅读并确认。如有疑问请联系：peihr85@gmail.com / 18897911681。</text></view>
</template>
<account-header id="account-subpage-header" id="subpage-header" title="{{title}}"/>
<view class="account view-{{view}}" style="padding-top:calc({{statusHeight}}px + 92rpx)">
 <view wx:if="{{missing}}" class="card empty-state"><text class="large">内容不存在或暂无访问权限</text><view class="page-actions"><button class="solid" data-view="orders" data-handler="go" bindtap="go">返回我的服务订单</button></view></view>
 <view wx:elif="{{learningDenied&&(view==='course'||view==='resource')}}" class="card empty">当前岗位无此学习内容权限</view>
 <block wx:elif="{{view==='selection'}}"><input class="search" placeholder="⌕ 搜索材料、规格" bindinput="search"/><view class="line-tabs"><button wx:for="{{['全部','外墙','门窗','屋面']}}" wx:key="*this" class="{{category===item?'active':''}}" data-key="category" data-value="{{item}}" data-handler="tab" bindtap="tab">{{item}}</button></view><image class="service-banner" src="/pages/account/assets/selection-banner.jpg" mode="aspectFill"/><view class="service-grid"><button wx:for="{{filteredProducts}}" wx:key="id" class="card" data-view="product" data-id="{{item.id}}" data-handler="go" bindtap="go"><image src="{{item.image}}" mode="aspectFill"/><text class="strong">{{item.name}}</text><text class="hint">{{item.spec}}</text><text class="product-inquiry">按需询价</text></button></view><text class="hint center">具体供货及报价以确认方案为准。</text></block>
 <block wx:elif="{{view==='product'}}"><block wx:if="{{product}}"><image class="service-hero" src="{{product.image}}" mode="aspectFill"/><view class="card"><view class="heading">{{product.name}}<text class="pill link">按需询价</text></view><text class="hint">{{product.spec}}</text></view><view class="card"><view class="heading">商品规格</view><view class="row"><text class="label">规格</text><text>{{product.spec}}</text></view><view class="row"><text class="label">计量单位</text><text>{{product.unit}}</text></view><view class="row"><text class="label">适用部位</text><text>{{product.category}}</text></view></view><view class="card"><view class="heading">供货说明</view><view class="row"><text class="label">报价方式</text><text>按数量与配送地点报价</text></view><view class="row"><text class="label">供货周期</text><text>询价后确认</text></view><view class="row"><text class="label">运费与卸货</text><text>报价时列明</text></view></view></block><view wx:else class="card empty">商品不存在</view></block>
 <block wx:elif="{{view==='procure'}}"><view class="card row"><image class="thumb" src="{{product.image}}" mode="aspectFill"/><view><text class="strong">{{product.name}}</text><text class="hint">{{product.spec}}</text></view></view><view class="card"><view class="heading">项目信息</view><view class="row"><text class="label">关联项目</text><picker range="{{projects}}" range-key="name" bindchange="pickProject"><text>{{selectedProjectName||'张先生 · 红安乡墅'}} ›</text></picker></view><view class="row"><text class="label">对应节点</text><text>{{product.category==='屋面'?'屋面施工':'外墙施工'}}</text></view><view class="row"><text class="label">采购范围</text><text>原合同范围</text></view></view><view class="card"><view class="heading">采购明细</view><view class="row"><text class="label">需求数量</text><input type="digit" placeholder="输入需求数量" value="{{form.quantity}}" data-key="quantity" bindinput="input"/><text>{{product.unit}}</text></view><view class="row"><text class="label">期望到货</text><picker mode="date" value="{{form.date}}" data-key="date" bindchange="input">{{form.date}} ›</picker></view></view><view class="card"><view class="heading">配送与费用</view><view class="row"><text class="label">地址</text><input value="{{form.address}}" data-key="address" bindinput="input"/></view><view class="row"><text class="label">收货人</text><input value="{{form.contact}}" data-key="contact" bindinput="input"/></view><view class="row"><text class="label">费用承担</text><text>加盟商</text></view></view><view class="card"><view class="heading">补充要求（选填）</view><textarea class="textarea" placeholder="请填写包装、卸货或其他要求" maxlength="200" value="{{form.note}}" data-key="note" bindinput="input"/></view><text class="hint center">提交后等待报价，不产生付款。</text><view class="page-actions"><button class="solid" data-handler="submitProcure" bindtap="submitProcure">提交采购需求</button></view></block>
 <block wx:elif="{{view==='purchases'}}"><input class="search" placeholder="⌕ 搜索项目或材料" bindinput="search"/><view class="line-tabs"><button wx:for="{{['全部','待报价','待确认','供货中','已完成']}}" wx:key="*this" class="{{orderTab===item?'active':''}}" data-key="orderTab" data-value="{{item}}" data-handler="tab" bindtap="tab">{{item}}</button></view><button wx:for="{{filteredPurchases}}" wx:key="id" class="card purchase-list" data-view="purchase" data-id="{{item.id}}" data-handler="go" bindtap="go"><view class="row"><text class="strong grow">{{item.project.name}}</text><text class="pill">{{item.status}}</text></view><view class="row"><image class="thumb" src="{{item.product.image}}" mode="aspectFill"/><view><text class="strong">{{item.product.name}}</text><text class="hint">{{item.product.spec}}</text><text class="hint">需求数量 {{item.quantity}}{{item.product.unit}}</text></view></view><view class="row"><text class="label">期望到货</text><text>{{item.date}}</text></view><text class="brown">{{item.quote?'报价 V'+item.quote.version+' · ¥'+item.quote.total:item.status==='供货中'?'供货安排已确认':'等待供应报价'}}　查看 ›</text></button><button class="card row" data-view="selection" data-handler="go" bindtap="go">浏览众墅甄选 ›</button></block>
 <block wx:elif="{{view==='purchase'}}"><button wx:if="{{purchase&&canPurchaseEngineering&&purchaseProject.engineeringId}}" class="card row" bindtap="openPurchaseProject">进入关联工程材料与供货流程 ›</button><view wx:if="{{!purchase}}" class="card empty">采购单不存在或无权访问</view><block wx:else><view class="card"><view class="heading">{{purchaseProject.name}}<text class="pill link">{{purchase.status}}</text></view><text class="hint">{{product.category==='屋面'?'屋面施工':'外墙施工'}} · 原合同范围 · {{purchase.id}}</text><view class="row"><image class="thumb" src="{{product.image}}" mode="aspectFill"/><view><text class="strong">{{product.name}}</text><text class="hint">{{product.spec}}</text><text class="hint">需求数量 {{purchase.quantity}}{{product.unit}}</text></view></view></view><view class="card"><view class="heading">供货报价 <text class="pill link">{{purchase.quote?'报价 V'+purchase.quote.version:'待报价'}}</text></view><block wx:if="{{purchase.quote}}"><view class="row"><text class="label">单价</text><text>¥{{purchase.quote.unitPrice}}/{{product.unit}}（含税）</text></view><view class="row"><text class="label">材料金额</text><text>¥{{purchase.quote.material}}</text></view><view class="row"><text class="label">运费</text><text>¥{{purchase.quote.freight}}（含卸货）</text></view><view class="row"><text class="label">合计</text><text class="strong brown">¥{{purchase.quote.total}}</text></view></block><text wx:else class="hint">等待供应方确认规格、税费和运费后报价。</text></view><view class="card"><view class="heading">到货安排</view><view class="row"><text class="label">约定到货</text><text>{{purchase.date}}</text></view><view class="row"><text class="label">收货地点</text><text>{{purchase.address||purchaseProject.address}}</text></view><view class="row"><text class="label">费用承担</text><text>加盟商</text></view><view class="row"><text class="label">确认人</text><text>{{purchaseProject.manager}}（项目联系人）</text></view></view><view class="card"><view class="heading">采购进度</view><view class="steps"><view wx:for="{{['需求已提交','报价待确认','待安排供货']}}" wx:key="*this"><text class="step-circle">{{index+1}}</text><text>{{item}}</text></view></view></view><block wx:if="{{purchase.status==='待确认'}}"><button class="check-row" data-handler="toggle" bindtap="toggle"><text class="checkbox {{checked?'selected':''}}">{{checked?'✓':''}}</text>已核对当前报价、数量与配送安排</button><view wx:if="{{canPurchaseQuote}}" class="page-actions"><button class="solid" data-handler="confirmPurchase" bindtap="confirmPurchase">确认采购方案</button></view></block><text class="hint center">确认仅记录采购方案，不发起付款。</text></block></block>
 <block wx:elif="{{view==='profile'}}">
  <view class="card profile-hero"><button open-type="chooseAvatar" bind:chooseavatar="onChooseAvatar" disabled="{{busy||profileLoading}}" loading="{{busy}}"><image src="{{profile.avatar}}" mode="aspectFill"/><image class="avatar-camera" src="/pages/account/assets/profile-camera.png" mode="aspectFit"/></button><text>{{profile.name||(profileLoading?'资料加载中…':'个人资料')}}</text></view>
  <view class="card"><view class="heading">基本信息</view><view class="inset"><view class="row"><text class="label">姓名</text><input type="nickname" value="{{form.name}}" maxlength="20" disabled="{{busy||profileLoading}}" data-key="name" bindinput="input"/></view><view class="row"><text class="label">手机</text><text class="grow">{{profileLoading?'加载中…':profileError&&!profile.phone?'待加载':maskedPhone}}</text></view><view class="row"><text class="label">公司</text><text class="grow">{{displayCompany}}</text></view><view class="row"><text class="label">岗位</text><text class="grow">{{role}}</text></view></view></view>
  <view wx:if="{{profileError}}" class="card"><text class="warn">{{profileError}}</text><button class="mini-action" bindtap="syncApiProfile">重新加载资料</button></view>
  <view class="page-actions"><button class="solid bottom-inline" data-handler="saveProfile" bindtap="saveProfile" disabled="{{busy||profileLoading}}" loading="{{busy}}">保存修改</button></view>
 </block>
 <block wx:elif="{{view==='learning'}}">
  <input class="search" placeholder="⌕  搜索课程、资料" value="{{keyword}}" bindinput="search"/><view class="seg"><button wx:for="{{['课程','资料']}}" wx:key="*this" class="{{tab===item?'active':''}}" data-value="{{item}}" data-handler="tab" bindtap="tab">{{item}}</button></view>
  <view class="categories"><button wx:for="{{categories}}" wx:key="*this" class="{{category===item?'active':''}}" data-key="category" data-value="{{item}}" data-handler="tab" bindtap="tab">{{item}}</button></view>
  <block wx:if="{{tab==='课程'}}"><view class="card"><view class="heading">继续学习</view><button wx:if="{{resumeCourse}}" class="course-row continue-row" data-id="{{resumeCourse.id}}" data-view="course" data-handler="go" bindtap="go"><image src="/pages/account/assets/course-continue.jpg" mode="aspectFill"/><view class="grow"><text class="strong">{{resumeCourse.name}}</text><text class="hint">已完成 {{progress.completed}} / {{progress.total}} 节</text><view class="progress-track"><view style="width:{{progress.percent}}%"/></view></view><text class="pill">继续学习 ›</text><text class="course-percent">{{progress.percent}}%</text></button></view><view class="card"><view class="heading">精选课程 <text class="link">我的学习 ›</text></view><button wx:for="{{filteredCourses}}" wx:key="id" class="course-row" data-id="{{item.id}}" data-handler="openCourse" bindtap="openCourse"><image src="{{item.image}}" mode="aspectFill"/><view class="grow"><text class="strong">{{item.name}}</text><text class="hint">{{item.category}} · {{item.lessons}}节课</text></view><text class="arrow">›</text></button><text wx:if="{{!filteredCourses.length}}" class="empty">暂无匹配课程，试试其他分类或关键词</text></view></block>
  <block wx:else><view class="card"><view class="heading">常用资料 <text class="link">最近更新 ›</text></view><button wx:for="{{filteredResources}}" wx:key="id" class="resource-row" data-id="{{item.id}}" data-handler="previewResource" bindtap="previewResource"><image src="/pages/account/assets/file.jpg"/><view class="grow"><text class="strong">{{item.name}}</text><text class="hint">{{item.type}} · {{item.category}} · {{item.version}} · {{item.date}}</text></view><text class="brown">预览 ›</text></button><text wx:if="{{!filteredResources.length}}" class="empty">暂无匹配资料</text></view><button class="card row" data-handler="favorites" bindtap="favorites"><image class="row-icon" src="/pages/account/assets/star.jpg"/><view class="grow"><text class="strong">{{favoritesOnly?'全部资料':'我的收藏'}}</text><text class="hint">常用资料，随时查阅</text></view><text class="arrow">›</text></button></block>
 </block>
 <block wx:elif="{{view==='course'}}">
  <button class="course-cover" data-handler="continueCourse" bindtap="continueCourse"><image src="{{courseImage}}" mode="aspectFill"/><text class="play">待上线</text></button><view class="card course-summary"><text class="large">{{currentCourse.name}}</text><text class="pill">{{currentCourse.category}} · 共{{progress.total}}节</text><view class="row"><text>已完成 <text class="brown strong">{{progress.completed}}</text> / {{progress.total}} 节</text><text class="link">{{progress.percent}}%</text></view><view class="progress-track"><view style="width:{{progress.percent}}%"/></view><button class="row inset" data-handler="continueCourse" bindtap="continueCourse"><text class="brown">◷</text><text class="grow hint">上次学到：第{{progress.current+1}}节 {{progress.chapter}}</text><text class="arrow">›</text></button></view>
  <view class="seg"><button wx:for="{{['课程目录','配套资料']}}" wx:key="*this" class="{{courseTab===item?'active':''}}" data-key="courseTab" data-value="{{item}}" data-handler="tab" bindtap="tab">{{item}}</button></view><view wx:if="{{courseTab==='课程目录'}}" class="card chapter-card"><button wx:for="{{chapters}}" wx:key="*this" wx:if="{{index<6||expanded}}" class="row" data-index="{{index}}" data-handler="lesson" bindtap="lesson"><text class="brown number">0{{index+1}}</text><text class="grow">{{item}}</text><view class="chapter-status {{index<=progress.completed?'brown':''}}"><text class="lesson-badge {{index<=progress.completed?'completed':''}}">{{index<progress.completed?'✓':'▶'}}</text><text wx:if="{{index<=progress.completed}}">{{index<progress.completed?'已完成':'待继续'}}</text></view></button><button class="hint center" data-handler="expand" bindtap="expand">{{expanded?'收起':'展开全部'+progress.total+'节'}} ﹀</button></view><view class="card compact"><view class="heading">配套资料</view><button class="row inset" data-id="{{currentCourse.resourceId}}" data-handler="previewResource" bindtap="previewResource"><image class="row-icon" src="/pages/account/assets/file.jpg"/><text class="grow">{{resourceName}}</text><text class="arrow">›</text></button></view><view class="page-actions"><button class="solid bottom-inline" data-handler="continueCourse" bindtap="continueCourse">{{progress.completed===progress.total?'回顾课程':'继续学习第'+(progress.current+1)+'节'}}</button></view>
 </block>
 <block wx:elif="{{view==='messages'}}">
  <view class="mc">
   <view class="seg mc-tabs"><button wx:for="{{messageTabs}}" wx:key="*this" class="{{messageTab===item?'active':''}}" data-key="messageTab" data-value="{{item}}" bindtap="messageChange">{{item}}</button></view>
   <view class="mc-search"><input placeholder="搜索客户、项目或业务编号" value="{{messageKeyword}}" maxlength="100" confirm-type="search" bindinput="messageSearchInput" bindconfirm="messageSearch"/><button bindtap="messageSearch">搜索</button></view>
   <view class="mc-filters"><button class="mc-chip {{messageMode==='ALL'?'selected':''}}" data-key="messageMode" data-value="ALL" bindtap="messageChange">全部</button><button class="mc-chip {{messageMode==='PENDING'?'selected':''}}" data-key="messageMode" data-value="PENDING" bindtap="messageChange">待我处理 <text>{{messagePending||0}}</text></button><button class="mc-chip {{messageMode==='UNREAD'?'selected':''}}" data-key="messageMode" data-value="UNREAD" bindtap="messageChange">未读 <text>{{unread||0}}</text></button></view>
   <view class="mc-toolbar"><picker range="{{messageModules}}" range-key="name" value="{{messageModuleIndex}}" bindchange="messageModuleChange"><view class="mc-module">{{messageModules[messageModuleIndex].name}} ▾</view></picker><button disabled="{{messageBusy||messageStatus!=='ready'||!unread}}" bindtap="readAll">全部标为已读</button></view>
   <text class="mc-explain">{{messageMode==='PENDING'?'当前岗位需要办理的事项，完成后自动移出':'只展示当前组织与你相关的消息'}}</text>
   <view wx:if="{{messagePartial}}" class="mc-warning">{{messagePartial}}<text bindtap="retryMessages">重新加载</text></view>
   <view wx:for="{{messages}}" wx:key="id" class="mc-card {{item.read?'':'is-unread'}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="messageDetails">
    <view class="mc-card-top"><text class="mc-category">{{item.module||item.type}}</text><text class="mc-state {{item.actionable?'todo':item.kind==='EXCEPTION'?'exception':''}}">{{item.stateLabel||'仅知会'}}</text><view wx:if="{{!item.read}}" class="mc-dot"/></view>
    <text wx:if="{{item.subject}}" class="mc-subject">{{item.subject}}</text>
    <text class="mc-title">{{item.title}}</text>
    <view wx:if="{{item.amount}}" class="mc-amount"><text>{{item.amountLabel}}</text><text>{{item.amount}}</text></view>
    <view wx:for="{{item.summary}}" wx:for-item="field" wx:key="index" class="mc-field"><text>{{field.label}}</text><text>{{field.value}}</text></view>
    <text wx:if="{{!item.subject&&!item.summary.length&&item.description}}" class="mc-description">{{item.description}}</text>
    <text wx:if="{{item.businessNo}}" class="mc-number">{{item.businessNo}}</text>
    <view wx:if="{{item.notice}}" class="mc-notice">{{item.notice}}</view>
    <view class="mc-card-bottom"><view class="mc-foot"><text wx:if="{{item.date}}">{{item.date}}</text><text wx:if="{{item.reason}}">{{item.reason}}</text></view><button wx:if="{{item.actionPath}}" class="mc-action {{item.actionable?'primary':''}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" catchtap="messageAction" disabled="{{messageBusy}}">{{item.actionLabel||'查看原单'}} ›</button><text wx:else class="mc-detail-link">查看消息 ›</text></view>
   </view>
   <view wx:if="{{messageStatus==='loading'}}" class="empty">消息加载中…</view>
   <view wx:if="{{messageError}}" class="mc-error" role="alert">{{messageError}}<button bindtap="retryMessages">重新加载</button></view>
   <view wx:if="{{messageStatus==='ready'&&!messages.length}}" class="mc-empty"><text>{{messageMode==='PENDING'?'当前没有待办事项':messageMode==='UNREAD'?'当前没有未读通知':'暂无符合条件的消息'}}</text><text>{{messageKeyword||messageModule?'可以调整关键词或模块筛选':'新的业务消息会显示在这里'}}</text></view>
   <button wx:if="{{messageHasMore}}" class="outline" disabled="{{messageStatus==='loading'}}" bindtap="moreMessages">加载更多消息</button>
  </view>
  <view wx:if="{{messageDetail}}" class="mc-mask" catchtap="closeMessageDetail"/>
  <view wx:if="{{messageDetail}}" class="mc-sheet"><view class="mc-sheet-head"><text>消息详情</text><button bindtap="closeMessageDetail">关闭</button></view><scroll-view scroll-y class="mc-sheet-body"><text class="mc-category">{{messageDetail.module}} · {{messageDetail.stateLabel}}</text><text class="mc-subject">{{messageDetail.subject}}</text><text class="mc-title">{{messageDetail.title}}</text><text class="mc-number">{{messageDetail.date}}</text><view wx:for="{{messageDetail.details}}" wx:key="index" class="mc-field"><text>{{item.label}}</text><text>{{item.value}}</text></view><text wx:if="{{messageDetail.description&&!messageDetail.details.length}}" class="mc-description">{{messageDetail.description}}</text><view wx:if="{{messageDetail.notice}}" class="mc-notice">{{messageDetail.notice}}</view><text class="mc-description">{{messageDetail.reason}}</text><text wx:if="{{messageDetail.historyNote}}" class="mc-number">{{messageDetail.historyNote}}</text><text class="mc-number">阅读通知不会完成业务办理。</text></scroll-view><button wx:if="{{messageDetail.actionPath}}" class="solid" data-id="{{messageDetail.id}}" disabled="{{messageBusy}}" bindtap="messageAction">{{messageDetail.actionLabel||'查看原单'}}</button></view>
 </block>
 <block wx:elif="{{view==='help'}}"><view class="card"><view class="heading">客服与帮助</view><text>反馈服务暂未开通，如需帮助请联系门店管理员。</text><button class="row" data-key="faq" data-handler="notice" bindtap="notice">常见问题 ›</button></view></block>
 <block wx:elif="{{view==='privacy'}}"><view class="card"><view class="heading">隐私与协议</view><button wx:for="{{[{name:'隐私政策',view:'policy'},{name:'隐私授权管理',view:'permissions'}]}}" wx:key="name" class="row" data-view="{{item.view}}" data-handler="go" bindtap="go"><image class="row-icon" src="/pages/account/assets/{{index===0?'privacy-doc':'privacy-permission'}}.jpg"/><text class="grow">{{item.name}}</text><text class="arrow">›</text></button></view><view class="card"><view class="heading">账号管理</view><button class="row" data-view="devices" data-handler="go" bindtap="go"><image class="symbol-image" src="/pages/account/assets/privacy-device.jpg" mode="aspectFit"/><text class="grow">登录设备</text><text class="arrow">›</text></button><button class="row" data-key="delete" data-handler="notice" bindtap="notice"><image class="symbol-image" src="/pages/account/assets/privacy-delete.jpg" mode="aspectFit"/><text class="grow">注销账号</text><text class="arrow">›</text></button><text class="hint">当前账号：{{profile.name}}</text></view></block>
 <block wx:elif="{{view==='services'}}"><input class="search" placeholder="⌕  搜索门店服务" value="{{keyword}}" bindinput="search"/><image class="service-banner" src="/pages/account/assets/service-banner.jpg" mode="aspectFill"/><view class="card three-grid"><button wx:for="{{['店招设计','展厅设计','品牌物料']}}" wx:key="*this" data-view="service" data-service="{{index===0?'store':index===1?'showroom':'brand'}}" data-handler="go" bindtap="go"><image class="service-category-icon" src="{{index===0?'/assets/account-shop.jpg':index===1?'/assets/house.png':'/assets/account-order.jpg'}}" mode="aspectFit"/>{{item}}</button></view><view class="card"><view class="heading">门店形象服务 <text class="link">查看全部 ›</text></view><view class="service-grid"><button wx:for="{{filteredServices}}" wx:key="id" wx:if="{{index<2}}" data-view="service" data-service="{{item.id}}" data-handler="go" bindtap="go"><image src="{{item.image}}" mode="aspectFill"/><text class="strong">{{item.name}}</text><text class="hint">{{item.desc}} ›</text></button></view><text wx:if="{{!filteredServices.length}}" class="empty">暂无匹配服务</text></view><button class="card row" data-view="service" data-service="brand" data-handler="go" bindtap="go"><image class="thumb" src="/pages/account/assets/service-brand.jpg" mode="aspectFill"/><view class="grow"><text class="strong">品牌物料</text><text class="hint">宣传册 · 名片 · 海报</text></view><text class="arrow">›</text></button><button class="card row" data-view="procurement" data-handler="go" bindtap="go"><image class="thumb" src="/pages/account/assets/service-material.jpg" mode="aspectFill"/><view class="grow"><text class="strong">众墅甄选</text><text class="hint">建材与配套采购</text></view><text class="pill">去逛逛 ›</text></button></block>
 <block wx:elif="{{view==='service'}}"><image class="service-hero" src="{{service.image}}" mode="aspectFill"/><view class="card"><view class="heading">{{service.name}}<text class="pill link">按需报价</text></view></view><view class="card"><view class="heading">服务内容</view><view wx:for="{{service.items}}" wx:key="*this" class="row"><image class="row-icon" src="/pages/account/assets/file.jpg"/><view class="grow"><text class="strong">{{item}}</text></view></view></view><view class="card"><view class="heading">交付说明</view><view class="row"><text class="label">制作与安装</text><text>另行确认</text></view><view class="row"><text class="label">交付周期</text><text>需求沟通后确认</text></view></view><view class="card row"><text class="brown">适用门店</text><text>新店开业 · 门店焕新</text></view></block>
 <block wx:elif="{{view==='request'}}"><view class="card row service-summary"><image class="thumb" src="{{service.image}}" mode="aspectFill"/><view><text class="strong">{{service.name}}</text><text class="hint">按需求报价</text></view></view><view class="card"><view class="heading">门店信息</view><view class="row"><text class="label">门店名称 <text class="required">*</text></text><text>{{company.store}}</text></view><view class="row"><text class="label">门店地址 <text class="required">*</text></text><input placeholder="请填写门店详细地址" value="{{form.address}}" data-key="address" bindinput="input"/></view></view><view class="card"><view class="heading">现场信息</view><view class="two-grid"><button class="photo-box" data-key="photos" data-handler="photo" bindtap="photo"><image wx:if="{{form.photos.length}}" src="{{form.photos[0]}}" mode="aspectFill"/><image wx:else class="symbol camera-image" src="/pages/account/assets/camera.jpg" mode="aspectFit"/><text>{{service.photoLabel}} <text class="required">*</text></text></button><button class="photo-box" data-key="sizePhotos" data-handler="photo" bindtap="photo"><image wx:if="{{form.sizePhotos.length}}" src="{{form.sizePhotos[0]}}" mode="aspectFill"/><image wx:else class="symbol camera-image" src="/pages/account/assets/camera.jpg" mode="aspectFit"/><text>尺寸照片</text></button></view><view class="row size-input"><text>{{service.id==='store'?'门头尺寸':'设计尺寸'}}</text><input placeholder="宽度（米）" type="digit" value="{{form.width}}" data-key="width" bindinput="input"/><text>×</text><input placeholder="高度（米）" type="digit" value="{{form.height}}" data-key="height" bindinput="input"/></view><text class="hint center">暂不清楚可在沟通时补充</text></view><view class="card"><view class="heading">补充需求</view><textarea class="textarea" placeholder="请描述门店现状、风格偏好及其他要求" maxlength="300" value="{{form.note}}" data-key="note" bindinput="input"/><text class="counter">{{form.note.length||0}}/300</text></view><view class="card"><view class="heading">联系人信息</view><view class="row"><text class="label">联系人</text><input value="{{form.contact}}" data-key="contact" bindinput="input"/></view><view class="row"><text class="label">联系电话 <text class="required">*</text></text><input placeholder="请填写联系电话" type="number" maxlength="11" value="{{form.phone}}" data-key="phone" bindinput="input"/></view></view><view class="page-actions"><button class="solid bottom-inline {{!form.address||!form.phone||!form.photos.length?'is-disabled':''}}" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{!form.address||!form.phone||!form.photos.length}}" data-handler="submitRequest" bindtap="submitRequest">提交需求</button></view><text class="hint center">{{!form.address||!form.phone||!form.photos.length?'请补充必填信息':'当前需求已保存在本机订单中'}}</text></block>
 <block wx:elif="{{view==='orders'}}"><input class="search" placeholder="⌕  搜索服务名称" value="{{keyword}}" bindinput="search"/><view class="inset order-scope">♙ {{company.store}} · {{profile.name}}<text class="hint">本人提交及授权订单</text></view><view class="line-tabs"><button wx:for="{{orderTabs}}" wx:key="*this" class="{{orderTab===item?'active':''}}" data-key="orderTab" data-value="{{item}}" data-handler="tab" bindtap="tab">{{item}}</button></view><button wx:for="{{orders}}" wx:key="id" class="card order-row" data-view="order" data-id="{{item.id}}" data-handler="go" bindtap="go"><image src="{{item.image}}" mode="aspectFill"/><view class="grow"><text class="strong">{{item.name}}</text><text class="hint">{{item.store}}　{{item.submitted}}提交</text><text class="hint">{{item.status==='待确认'?'方案待负责人确认':item.status==='已完成'?'交付文件可查看':item.status==='取消处理中'?'取消处理中，款项待核实':'服务方将与你联系'}}</text><view class="order-button">查看{{item.status==='已完成'?'交付':'详情'}}</view></view><text class="pill">{{item.status}}</text></button><view wx:if="{{!orders.length}}" class="card empty">暂无匹配订单</view></block>
 <block wx:elif="{{view==='order'}}"><view class="card order-state"><text class="symbol">◷</text><view><text class="strong brown">{{order.status==='待确认'?'方案待负责人确认':order.status}}</text><text class="hint">{{order.plan?'已提交方案 V'+order.plan.version:'等待需求沟通'}}</text></view><view class="steps"><view wx:for="{{['需求沟通','方案设计','方案确认','文件交付']}}" wx:key="*this"><text class="step-circle">{{index+1}}</text><text>{{item}}</text></view></view></view><view class="card row"><view class="grow"><text class="strong">{{order.name}}</text><text class="hint">服务门店　{{order.store}}</text><text class="hint">提交人　{{order.applicant}}</text><text class="hint">订单号　{{order.id}}</text></view><image class="thumb" src="{{order.service==='showroom'?'/pages/account/assets/service-showroom.jpg':order.service==='brand'?'/pages/account/assets/service-brand.jpg':'/pages/account/assets/service-store.jpg'}}" mode="aspectFill"/></view><view wx:if="{{order.plan}}" class="card"><text class="strong">最新方案</text><button class="plan-preview" data-handler="previewPlan" bindtap="previewPlan"><image src="{{order.plan.image}}" mode="aspectFill"/></button><button class="row" data-view="plan" data-id="{{order.id}}" data-handler="go" bindtap="go"><view class="grow"><text class="strong">{{order.plan.name}}</text><text class="hint">更新于 {{order.plan.date}}</text></view><text class="brown">查看方案 ›</text></button></view><button class="card row" data-key="quote" data-handler="notice" bindtap="notice"><image class="row-icon" src="/pages/account/assets/file.jpg"/><text class="grow">服务报价</text><text class="brown">查看报价记录 ›</text></button><button class="card row" data-view="delivery" data-id="{{order.id}}" data-handler="go" bindtap="go"><image class="row-icon" src="/assets/account-order.jpg"/><view class="grow"><text>交付记录</text><text class="hint">{{order.delivery?'查看当前版本交付文件':'方案确认后按约定交付'}}</text></view><text class="pill">{{order.delivery?order.delivery.received?'已接收':'待接收':'尚未交付'}}</text></button><view class="card"><view class="heading">服务动态</view><view wx:for="{{order.events}}" wx:key="at" class="event"><text class="brown">•</text><text class="hint">{{item.at}}　{{item.text}}</text></view></view><view class="page-actions"><button wx:if="{{isServiceProvider&&(order.status==='待沟通'||order.status==='进行中'&&!order.confirmation)}}" class="outline" data-action="demo-plan" data-handler="orderAction" bindtap="orderAction">提交方案</button><button wx:if="{{isServiceProvider&&order.status==='进行中'&&order.confirmation}}" class="outline" data-action="demo-delivery" data-handler="orderAction" bindtap="orderAction">提交成果</button><button wx:if="{{isServiceProvider&&order.status==='交付待修正'}}" class="outline" data-action="demo-redelivery" data-handler="orderAction" bindtap="orderAction">补交文件</button><button wx:if="{{!isServiceProvider&&(order.status==='待沟通'||order.status==='待确认'||order.status==='进行中')}}" class="outline" data-action="cancel" data-handler="orderAction" bindtap="orderAction">申请取消</button><button wx:if="{{order.cancel}}" class="outline" data-view="cancel" data-id="{{order.id}}" data-handler="go" bindtap="go">查看取消进度</button><button class="solid bottom-inline" data-key="contact" data-handler="notice" bindtap="notice">联系服务方</button></view><text class="hint center">确认操作由门店负责人处理</text></block>
 <block wx:elif="{{view==='plan'}}"><view wx:if="{{!order.plan}}" class="card empty">方案尚未提交</view><block wx:else><view class="card row inset"><text class="symbol">◷</text><view><text class="strong brown">{{order.confirmation?'方案已确认':'方案待确认'}}</text><text class="hint">当前身份：{{role}}</text></view></view><view class="card"><view class="row"><text class="strong grow">{{order.plan.name}}</text><button class="brown" data-handler="previewPlan" bindtap="previewPlan">查看完整方案 ›</button></view><text class="hint">更新时间 {{order.plan.date}}</text><button class="plan-preview" data-handler="previewPlan" bindtap="previewPlan"><image src="{{order.plan.image}}" mode="aspectFill"/></button></view><view class="card"><view class="heading">方案信息</view><view class="row"><text class="label">设计范围</text><text>{{order.name}}</text></view><view class="row"><text class="label">服务门店</text><text>{{order.store}}</text></view><view class="row"><text class="label">提交人</text><text>{{order.applicant}}</text></view></view><button class="card row" data-key="quote" data-handler="notice" bindtap="notice"><text class="grow">服务报价</text><text class="brown">查看报价记录 ›</text></button><view wx:if="{{canConfirmService&&order.status==='待确认'}}" class="card"><view class="heading">修改意见 <text class="link muted">选填</text></view><textarea class="textarea" maxlength="500" placeholder="请填写需要调整的内容" value="{{form.note}}" data-key="note" bindinput="input"/></view><button wx:if="{{canConfirmService&&order.status==='待确认'}}" class="check-row" data-handler="toggle" bindtap="toggle"><text class="checkbox {{checked?'selected':''}}">{{checked?'✓':''}}</text><text>已查看并核对当前 V{{planVersion}} 方案文件</text></button><view wx:if="{{canConfirmService&&order.status==='待确认'}}" class="page-actions"><button class="outline" data-action="return-plan" data-handler="orderAction" bindtap="orderAction">返回修改</button><button class="solid" data-action="confirm-plan" data-handler="orderAction" bindtap="orderAction">确认此方案</button></view><text class="hint center">确认后进入文件交付，不发起付款。</text></block></block>
 <block wx:elif="{{view==='delivery'}}"><view wx:if="{{!order.delivery}}" class="card empty">尚未交付，方案确认后按约定交付文件。</view><block wx:else><view class="card inset"><view class="row"><text class="symbol">◷</text><view><text class="strong brown">{{order.delivery.received?'成果已接收':'成果已交付 · 待接收'}}</text><text class="hint">方案 V{{order.delivery.version}} 已确认</text></view></view><view class="row"><text>服务门店　{{order.store}}</text><text>提交人　{{order.applicant}}</text></view></view><view class="card"><view class="heading">项目预览</view><image class="delivery-preview" src="{{order.plan.image}}" mode="aspectFill"/></view><view class="card"><view class="heading">交付成果</view><button wx:for="{{order.delivery.files}}" wx:key="name" class="row" data-index="{{index}}" data-handler="previewDelivery" bindtap="previewDelivery"><image class="row-icon" src="/pages/account/assets/{{index===0?'pdf':'zip'}}.jpg"/><text class="grow strong">{{item.name}}</text><text class="pill">{{index===0?'可预览':'电脑端下载'}}</text></button></view><view class="card"><view class="heading">交付记录</view><text class="hint">服务方已上传　{{order.delivery.at||order.submitted}}</text><button class="row" data-view="plan" data-id="{{order.id}}" data-handler="go" bindtap="go"><text class="grow">方案确认记录</text><text class="arrow">›</text></button></view><view wx:if="{{order.status==='交付待修正'}}" class="card"><text class="brown">已提出交付问题，等待服务方修正。</text><view class="page-actions"><button class="outline" data-view="order" data-id="{{order.id}}" data-handler="go" bindtap="go">返回订单跟进</button></view></view><view wx:if="{{!isServiceProvider&&!order.delivery.received&&order.status!=='交付待修正'}}" class="card"><textarea class="textarea" placeholder="如有问题，请说明具体缺失或需调整的文件" maxlength="500" value="{{form.note}}" data-key="note" bindinput="input"/><button class="check-row" data-handler="toggle" bindtap="toggle"><text class="checkbox {{checked?'selected':''}}">{{checked?'✓':''}}</text>已核对交付文件完整性</button><view class="page-actions"><button class="outline" data-action="delivery-issue" data-handler="orderAction" bindtap="orderAction">提出问题</button><button wx:if="{{canConfirmService}}" class="solid" data-action="receive" data-handler="orderAction" bindtap="orderAction">确认接收</button></view></view></block></block>
 <block wx:elif="{{view==='cancel'}}"><view wx:if="{{!order.cancel}}" class="card empty">该订单尚无取消申请</view><block wx:else><view class="card inset"><text class="strong brown">{{order.status}}</text><text class="hint">{{order.cancel.paymentStatus}}</text></view><view class="card cancel-order"><view class="heading">订单信息</view><image wx:if="{{order.plan}}" class="cancel-thumb" src="{{order.plan.image}}" mode="aspectFill"/><view class="row"><text class="label">服务门店</text><text>{{order.store}}</text></view><view class="row"><text class="label">服务内容</text><text>{{order.name}}</text></view><view class="row"><text class="label">提交人</text><text>{{order.applicant}}</text></view></view><view class="card"><view class="heading">取消详情</view><text class="body-text">取消原因　{{order.cancel.reason}}</text><text class="hint">申请时间　{{order.cancel.at}}</text></view><view class="card"><view class="heading">处理进度</view><text class="event">✓ 取消申请已提交</text><text class="event brown">{{order.cancel.status}}</text><text class="hint">{{order.status==='已取消'?'取消核实已完成':'原订单与核实依据保留'}}</text></view><view class="card"><view class="heading">款项处理</view><view class="row"><text class="label">已付款情况</text><text class="pill">{{order.cancel.paymentStatus}}</text></view><view class="row"><text class="label">退款处理</text><text class="pill">{{order.cancel.refundStatus}}</text></view><text class="hint">款项核实后再办理，不自动退款。</text></view><view class="page-actions"><button class="outline" data-view="order" data-id="{{order.id}}" data-handler="go" bindtap="go">查看原订单</button><button wx:if="{{isServiceProvider&&order.status==='取消处理中'}}" class="solid" data-action="cancel-resolve" bindtap="orderAction">核实取消申请</button><button wx:else class="solid" data-key="contact" data-handler="notice" bindtap="notice">联系服务方</button></view></block></block>
 <block wx:elif="{{view==='login'}}">
  <view class="login-intro"><image class="login-brand" src="/assets/brand.png" mode="aspectFit"/></view>
  <view class="card login-card">
   <view class="seg"><button wx:for="{{['账号密码登录','微信一键登录']}}" wx:key="*this" class="{{loginMode===(index===0?'account':'wechat')?'active':''}}" data-mode="{{index===0?'account':'wechat'}}" bindtap="selectLoginMode">{{item}}</button></view>
   <block wx:if="{{loginMode==='account'}}">
    <view class="row inset account-search"><text class="label">账号</text><input class="grow" maxlength="100" placeholder="请输入管理员提供的完整账号" value="{{form.accountQuery}}" data-key="accountQuery" bindinput="input" confirm-type="next"/></view>
    <view class="row inset login-password-row"><text class="label">密码</text><input class="grow login-password-input" password="{{!passwordVisible}}" maxlength="64" placeholder="请输入密码" value="{{form.password}}" data-key="password" bindinput="input" disabled="{{loginBusy}}"/><button class="password-visibility" aria-label="{{passwordVisible?'隐藏密码':'显示密码'}}" aria-pressed="{{passwordVisible}}" data-field="password" bindtap="togglePasswordVisibility">{{passwordVisible?'隐藏':'显示'}}</button></view>
    <block wx:if="{{passwordChangeRequired}}"><text class="change-password-title">设置新密码</text>
     <view class="row inset login-password-row"><text class="label">新密码</text><input class="grow login-password-input" password="{{!newPasswordVisible}}" maxlength="64" placeholder="6–64位密码" value="{{form.newPassword}}" data-key="newPassword" bindinput="input"/><button class="password-visibility" aria-label="{{newPasswordVisible?'隐藏新密码':'显示新密码'}}" data-field="newPassword" bindtap="togglePasswordVisibility">{{newPasswordVisible?'隐藏':'显示'}}</button></view>
     <view class="row inset login-password-row"><text class="label">确认密码</text><input class="grow login-password-input" password="{{!confirmPasswordVisible}}" maxlength="64" placeholder="再次输入新密码" value="{{form.confirmPassword}}" data-key="confirmPassword" bindinput="input"/><button class="password-visibility" aria-label="{{confirmPasswordVisible?'隐藏确认密码':'显示确认密码'}}" data-field="confirmPassword" bindtap="togglePasswordVisibility">{{confirmPasswordVisible?'隐藏':'显示'}}</button></view>
    </block>
    <view class="row login-remember-row"><button class="check-row remember-account" bindtap="toggleRememberDefault"><text class="checkbox {{rememberDefault?'selected':''}}">{{rememberDefault?'✓':''}}</text>记住账号并自动登录</button><button wx:if="{{defaultAccount}}" class="mini-action" data-handler="clearDefaultAccount" bindtap="clearDefaultAccount">忘记账号</button></view>
    <view class="page-actions"><button class="solid {{loginBusy?'is-disabled':''}}" loading="{{loginBusy}}" disabled="{{loginBusy}}" data-handler="{{passwordChangeRequired?'submitNewPassword':'accountLogin'}}" bindtap="{{passwordChangeRequired?'submitNewPassword':'accountLogin'}}">{{passwordChangeRequired?'确认并登录':'登录'}}</button></view>
    <view wx:if="{{passwordLoginRecovery}}" class="login-recovery"><text class="hint">可使用微信登录，或联系管理员核实身份后重置密码。</text><button class="outline" data-mode="wechat" bindtap="selectLoginMode">微信登录</button></view>
   </block>
    <block wx:else><view class="page-actions wechat-actions"><button wx:if="{{!wechatPhoneRequired}}" class="solid wechat-login-btn {{loginBusy?'is-disabled':''}}" bindtap="wechatLogin" loading="{{loginBusy}}" disabled="{{loginBusy}}"><image class="wechat-login-icon" src="/pages/account/assets/wechat-logo.png" mode="aspectFit"/><text>微信一键登录</text></button><button wx:else class="solid wechat-login-btn" open-type="getPhoneNumber" bindgetphonenumber="onWechatPhoneNumber" data-generation="{{wechatPhoneGeneration}}" loading="{{loginBusy}}" disabled="{{loginBusy}}"><image class="wechat-login-icon" src="/pages/account/assets/wechat-logo.png" mode="aspectFit"/><text>授权手机号并登录</text></button></view></block>
  </view>
 </block>
 <block wx:elif="{{view==='identity'}}"><view class="card row"><image class="avatar-small" src="{{profile.avatar}}" mode="aspectFill"/><view><text class="large">{{profile.name||(profileLoading?'资料加载中…':'个人资料')}}</text><text wx:if="{{profileError}}" class="warn">{{profileError}}</text><text wx:if="{{apiLoggedIn}}" class="hint">当前身份：{{apiCurrentName}}</text></view></view><block wx:if="{{apiLoggedIn}}"><view class="card"><view class="heading">可用岗位</view><button wx:for="{{apiRoleOptions}}" wx:key="postId" class="identity-option {{item.selected?'selected-option':''}}" data-post-id="{{item.postId}}" data-handler="selectApiPost" bindtap="selectApiPost"><image class="symbol-image" src="/pages/account/assets/identity-company.jpg"/><view class="grow"><text class="strong">{{item.name}} {{item.lead}}</text><text class="hint">{{item.orgName || item.orgType}}{{item.enabled?"":" · 暂未开放"}}</text></view><text class="brown">{{item.selected?'●':'○'}}</text></button></view><view class="page-actions"><button wx:if="{{apiCanManage}}" class="solid" data-view="api-members" data-handler="go" bindtap="go">管理本店成员与权限 ›</button><button class="outline" data-handler="logoutApi" bindtap="logoutApi">退出账号</button></view></block><block wx:else><view class="card"><view class="heading">当前公司</view><view class="row inset"><image class="symbol-image" src="/pages/account/assets/identity-company.jpg"/><text class="strong grow">{{company.name}}</text><button class="brown" data-key="companies" data-handler="notice" bindtap="notice">切换公司 ›</button></view><text class="hint">仅可选择已加入的公司</text></view><view class="card"><view class="heading">已授权工作身份</view><button wx:for="{{roleOptions}}" wx:key="id" class="identity-option {{selectedRole===item.id?'selected-option':''}}" data-role="{{item.id}}" data-handler="selectRole" bindtap="selectRole"><image class="symbol-image" src="/pages/account/assets/{{item.id==='engineer'||item.id==='project-manager'?'identity-manager':'identity-sales'}}.jpg"/><view class="grow"><text class="strong">{{item.name}}</text><text class="hint">{{item.description}}</text></view><text class="brown">{{selectedRole===item.id?'●':'○'}}</text></button><text class="hint">仅显示管理员已分配的身份</text></view><view class="card"><view class="heading">切换后</view><text class="body-text">进入对应工作台</text><text class="body-text">按当前身份查看可用内容</text></view><view class="page-actions"><button class="solid" data-handler="switchRole" bindtap="switchRole">确认切换</button></view></block></block>
 <block wx:elif="{{view==='api-members'}}"><view class="card"><view class="heading">添加成员</view><text class="hint">管理员指派制：由你把成员关联到部门与岗位，员工登录后自动发现身份。</text><view class="row inset"><text class="label">部门</text><picker class="grow" range="{{apiTeamOptions}}" range-key="name" data-key="teamIndex" bindchange="pickMemberField"><view>{{apiTeamOptions.length?apiTeamOptions[form.teamIndex].name+' ›':'全店（不分组） ›'}}</view></picker></view><view class="row inset"><text class="label">岗位</text><picker class="grow" range="{{apiRoleOptionsForAdd}}" range-key="name" data-key="roleIndex" bindchange="pickMemberField"><view>{{apiRoleOptionsForAdd[form.roleIndex].name}} ›</view></picker></view><view class="row inset"><text class="label">姓名</text><input class="grow" value="{{form.memberName}}" maxlength="20" placeholder="员工姓名" data-key="memberName" bindinput="input"/></view><view class="row inset"><text class="label">手机号</text><input class="grow" type="number" maxlength="11" placeholder="联系手机（11位）" value="{{form.memberMobile}}" data-key="memberMobile" bindinput="input"/></view><view class="page-actions"><button class="solid {{apiMembersBusy?'is-disabled':''}}" loading="{{apiMembersBusy}}" disabled="{{apiMembersBusy}}" data-handler="addMember" bindtap="addMember">加入并指派岗位</button></view><text class="hint center">门店员工使用生成的独立账号密码登录，并可绑定微信；选择「业务负责人」即拥有本部门管理范围。</text></view><view wx:if="{{staffAccountDelivery}}" class="card"><view class="heading">员工账号已开通</view><text class="strong">{{staffAccountDelivery.personName}} · {{staffAccountDelivery.roleName}}</text><view class="inset"><text class="strong">{{staffAccountDelivery.shortOrgName||staffAccountDelivery.orgName}}</text><text class="body-text">账号：{{staffAccountDelivery.loginName}}</text><text wx:if="{{staffAccountDelivery.aliases.length}}" class="hint">可用简写：{{staffAccountDelivery.aliasesText}}</text><text wx:if="{{staffAccountDelivery.initialPassword}}" class="warn">一次性初始密码：{{staffAccountDelivery.initialPassword}}</text><text wx:else class="hint">该员工已有账号，密码沿用原密码。</text></view><text wx:if="{{staffAccountDelivery.initialPassword}}" class="hint">初始密码仅本次显示，请在48小时内登录改密；微信登录后初始密码失效。</text><view class="page-actions"><button class="solid" data-handler="copyStaffAccount" bindtap="copyStaffAccount">一键复制账号</button></view></view><view class="card"><view class="heading">在岗成员 {{apiStaffRows.length}} 人</view><view wx:for="{{apiStaffRows}}" wx:key="postId" class="row inset"><view class="grow"><text class="strong">{{item.roleName}}</text><text class="hint">{{item.name}} · {{item.mobile}} · {{item.teamName||'全店'}}</text><text wx:if="{{item.suspendBlockedReason}}" class="hint">{{item.suspendBlockedReason}}</text></view><button wx:if="{{!item.revokeBlockedReason}}" class="mini-action" data-post-id="{{item.postId}}" data-name="{{item.name}}" data-handler="revokeRow" bindtap="revokeRow">撤销</button><button wx:if="{{!item.suspendBlockedReason}}" class="mini-action {{item.active?'':'warn'}}" data-user-id="{{item.userId}}" data-name="{{item.name}}" data-active="{{item.active}}" data-handler="toggleActiveRow" bindtap="toggleActiveRow">{{item.active?'停用':'启用'}}</button></view><text wx:if="{{!apiStaffRows.length}}" class="empty">暂无成员，先用上方表单添加</text></view><block wx:if="{{apiCanManage}}"><view wx:if="{{apiLeavers.length||handoverSource}}" class="card"><view class="heading">离职交接</view><text class="hint">选择接收人，移交客户、委托和工程等个人负责事项后办理离职；组织共享账款由财务岗继续处理。</text><view class="row inset"><input class="grow" value="{{handoverSearchQuery}}" maxlength="64" placeholder="原员工姓名、手机号或编号" bindinput="inputHandoverSearch" bindconfirm="searchHandoverHistory"/><button class="mini-action" loading="{{handoverSearchBusy}}" disabled="{{handoverSearchBusy}}" bindtap="searchHandoverHistory">查找原员工</button></view><text class="hint">找不到离职来源时，可检索本组织曾任职员工，核实旧的在途事项并补交接。</text><text wx:if="{{handoverSearchError}}" class="warn">{{handoverSearchError}}</text><view wx:for="{{handoverSearchRows}}" wx:for-item="person" wx:key="userId" class="row inset"><view class="grow"><text class="strong">{{person.name}}</text><text class="hint">{{person.mobile}} · 编号 {{person.userId}}</text></view><button class="mini-action" data-user-id="{{person.userId}}" bindtap="selectHandoverHistory">选择补交接</button></view><text wx:if="{{handoverSearchPage&&!handoverSearchRows.length}}" class="hint">未找到本组织曾任职的员工，请核对姓名、手机号或编号。</text><button wx:if="{{handoverSearchHasMore}}" class="mini-action" data-more="{{true}}" disabled="{{handoverSearchBusy}}" bindtap="searchHandoverHistory">查看更多原员工</button><view class="row inset"><text class="label">离职成员</text><picker class="grow" range="{{apiLeavers}}" range-key="name" bindchange="pickHandoverLeaver"><view>{{handoverSource?handoverSource.name+'（'+handoverSource.roleName+'）':'请选择 ›'}}</view></picker></view><block wx:if="{{handoverSource}}"><text wx:if="{{handoverPreviewBusy}}" class="hint">正在读取在办事项…</text><view wx:elif="{{handoverPreviewError}}"><text class="warn">{{handoverPreviewError}}</text><button class="mini-action" bindtap="loadHandoverPreview">重试读取</button></view><block wx:elif="{{handoverPreviewReady}}"><text wx:if="{{handoverRequirements.length}}" class="hint">请为以下在办事项分别选择接收人，可以由不同员工承接。</text><text wx:else class="hint">已确认没有需要选择接收人的个人在办事项，可直接完成离职撤权。</text><view wx:for="{{handoverRequirements}}" wx:key="domain" class="row inset"><view class="label"><text>{{item.label}}</text><text class="hint">在办 {{item.inFlight}} 项</text></view><picker class="grow" range="{{apiReceivers}}" range-key="name" value="{{item.targetIndex}}" data-domain="{{item.domain}}" disabled="{{handoverBusy}}" bindchange="pickHandoverTarget"><view>{{item.targetName}} ›</view></picker></view></block></block><text wx:if="{{handoverSource.removalBlockedReason}}" class="warn">{{handoverSource.removalBlockedReason}}</text><view class="page-actions"><button class="solid {{handoverBusy||apiMembersBusy||handoverSource.removalBlockedReason||!handoverPreviewReady||handoverPreviewBusy||handoverPreviewError?'is-disabled':''}}" loading="{{handoverBusy}}" disabled="{{handoverBusy||apiMembersBusy||handoverSource.removalBlockedReason||!handoverPreviewReady||handoverPreviewBusy||handoverPreviewError}}" bindtap="confirmHandover">发起正常交接</button><button class="outline" disabled="{{handoverBusy||apiMembersBusy||handoverSource.removalBlockedReason}}" bindtap="confirmEmergency">紧急撤权（不等待交接）</button></view><text class="hint">紧急撤权仅用于突发离职等必须立即收权的情形：立即撤销任职与钱包会话，个人负责的在途事项转入下方待分配清单，可事后补交接；组织共享账款由财务岗继续处理。</text><text wx:if="{{reassignHint}}" class="hint">{{reassignHint}}</text></view><view wx:if="{{handoverResult}}" class="card"><view class="heading">{{handoverResult.title}}</view><view wx:for="{{handoverResult.items}}" wx:key="label" class="row inset"><view class="grow"><text class="strong">{{item.label}}</text><text class="hint">{{item.inFlightText}}{{item.transferredText?' · '+item.transferredText:''}}</text><text wx:if="{{item.receiverName}}" class="hint">接收人：{{item.receiverName}}</text></view><text class="{{item.statusText==='转待分配'?'warn':''}}">{{item.statusText}}</text></view><text wx:if="{{handoverResult.openCount}}" class="hint">存在转待分配事项时，请在下方清单对相应域发起补交接。</text></view><view wx:if="{{apiPendingRows.length}}" class="card"><view class="heading">待分配在途事项 {{apiPendingRows.length}} 组</view><text class="hint">紧急撤权后未交接的在途对象；补交接将移交该成员的全部在途事项（含各域），完成后此处行自动关闭。</text><text wx:if="{{handoverPendingError}}" class="warn">待分配清单刷新失败，以下为上次结果，请下拉重试。</text><view wx:for="{{apiPendingRows}}" wx:key="id" class="row inset"><view class="grow"><text class="strong">{{item.fromName}} · {{item.domainLabel}}</text><text class="hint">{{item.inFlightText}} · {{item.createTime}}</text></view><button class="mini-action {{handoverBusy||apiMembersBusy?'is-disabled':''}}" data-user-id="{{item.fromUserId}}" data-name="{{item.fromName}}" disabled="{{handoverBusy||apiMembersBusy}}" bindtap="reassignRow">补交接（移交全部在途）</button></view></view></block></block>
 <block wx:elif="{{view==='access'}}"><view class="access-intro"><image class="lock-symbol" src="/pages/account/assets/access-lock.jpg" mode="aspectFit"/><text class="large">暂时没有访问权限</text><text class="hint">当前身份未获此功能授权</text><text class="hint">如需使用，请联系公司管理员</text></view><view class="card"><view class="row"><text class="label grow">当前公司</text><text>{{company.name}}</text></view><view class="row"><text class="label grow">当前身份</text><text>{{role}}</text></view><view class="row"><text class="label grow">访问内容</text><text>{{accessLabel}}</text></view></view><view class="page-actions"><button class="solid" data-handler="backHome" bindtap="backHome">返回工作台</button><button class="outline" data-view="identity" data-handler="go" bindtap="go">切换工作身份</button></view><text class="divider">权限开通后，可重新进入</text></block>
 <block wx:elif="{{view==='resource'}}"><view wx:if="{{resource}}" class="card"><view class="heading">{{resource.name}}</view><text class="hint">{{resource.type}} · {{resource.category}} · {{resource.version}} · {{resource.date}}</text><view class="document-preview"><image src="/pages/account/assets/file.jpg"/><text class="strong">资料尚未上线</text><text class="hint">当前可查看资料目录，文件上线后开放阅读。</text></view><view class="page-actions"><button class="outline" data-handler="favorite" bindtap="favorite">{{resourceFavorite?'取消收藏':'收藏资料'}}</button></view></view><view wx:else class="card empty">资料不存在</view></block>
 <block wx:elif="{{view==='policy'}}"><template is="loginPrivacy" data="{{showAgreement:true}}"/></block>
 <block wx:elif="{{view==='agreement'}}"><template is="loginAgreement"/> </block>
 <block wx:else><view class="card"><view class="heading">{{title}}</view><text class="body-text">{{view==='devices'?'当前设备已登录。其他设备的登录记录暂不支持查看，可从工作身份页退出当前账号。':view==='binding'?'当前手机号用于员工登录与任职识别。如需更换，请联系门店管理员核对身份后处理。':'可在微信设置中管理相册等系统权限。公司业务权限由管理员分配。'}}</text><view class="page-actions"><button class="outline" data-view="privacy" data-handler="go" bindtap="go">返回账号与隐私</button></view></view></block>
 <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view>
</view>
<action-panel wx:if="{{modal&&(modal.type==='notice'||modal.type==='preview'||modal.type==='logout'||modal.type==='demo')}}" workbench="{{true}}" panel="{{modal}}" bind:close="closeModal" bind:submit="confirmModal"/><view wx:elif="{{modal}}" class="overlay" data-handler="closeModal" bindtap="closeModal"><view class="sheet" catchtap="noop"><button class="sheet-close" data-handler="closeModal" bindtap="closeModal">×</button><text class="large">{{modal.title}}</text><image wx:if="{{modal.image}}" class="modal-image" src="{{modal.image}}" mode="widthFix"/><text wx:if="{{modal.text}}" class="body-text">{{modal.text}}</text><block wx:if="{{modal.type==='lesson'}}"><image class="modal-image" src="{{courseImage}}" mode="widthFix"/><text class="body-text">视频准备中，可先查看配套资料。</text></block><block wx:if="{{modal.type==='cancel-resolution'}}"><picker range="{{['核实未收款，取消','退回取消申请','款项待核实']}}" bindchange="pickCancel"><view class="outline">{{form.cancelResult||'选择核实结果'}}</view></picker><textarea class="textarea" placeholder="填写原渠道核实说明" data-key="note" bindinput="input"/><button class="outline" data-key="cancelProof" bindtap="photo">上传核实依据（{{form.cancelProof.length||0}}）</button><button class="outline" bindtap="toggle">{{checked?'☑':'□'}} 已核对原订单与原渠道款项</button></block><textarea wx:if="{{modal.type==='cancel'}}" class="textarea" placeholder="请填写取消原因，款项需另行核实" maxlength="300" value="{{form.note}}" data-key="note" bindinput="input"/><text wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</text><button class="solid" data-handler="confirmModal" bindtap="confirmModal">{{modal.type==='lesson'?'标记本节学习完成':modal.type==='cancel'?'提交取消申请':'确认'}}</button></view></view>

<view wx:if="{{paymentReceipt}}" class="payment-receipt-mask"><view class="payment-receipt-panel"><button class="payment-receipt-close" bindtap="closePaymentReceipt">关闭</button><view class="payment-receipt-check {{paymentReceipt.channel==='alipay'?'ali':''}}">✓</view><text class="payment-receipt-title">付款登记完成</text><text class="payment-receipt-amount">{{paymentReceipt.amount}}</text><text class="payment-receipt-merchant">{{paymentReceipt.recipient}}</text><view class="payment-receipt-row"><text>项目客户</text><text>{{paymentReceipt.customerName}}</text></view><view class="payment-receipt-row"><text>计费依据</text><text>{{paymentReceipt.area}}㎡ × {{paymentReceipt.rate}}/㎡</text></view><view class="payment-receipt-row"><text>付款方式</text><text>{{paymentReceipt.channelName}} · {{paymentReceipt.method}}</text></view><view class="payment-receipt-row"><text>订单编号</text><text>{{paymentReceipt.number}}</text></view><view class="payment-receipt-row"><text>登记时间</text><text>{{paymentReceipt.paidAt}}</text></view><text class="payment-receipt-note">模拟登记 · 不计入正式实收实付</text><button class="solid" bindtap="closePaymentReceipt">完成</button></view></view>

<view wx:if="{{view==='login'&&consentOpen}}" class="login-consent-mask" catchtouchmove="noop">
 <view class="login-consent-panel" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-label="用户协议与隐私政策">
  <block wx:if="{{consentDocument}}"><view class="login-consent-heading">{{consentDocument==='agreement'?'用户协议':'隐私政策'}}</view><scroll-view class="login-document-scroll" scroll-y="{{true}}"><template is="{{consentDocument==='agreement'?'loginAgreement':'loginPrivacy'}}"/></scroll-view><button class="outline" bindtap="backToConsent">返回确认</button></block>
  <block wx:else><view class="login-consent-heading">用户协议与隐私政策</view><view class="login-consent-links"><button data-document="agreement" bindtap="readLoginDocument">《用户协议》</button><button data-document="policy" bindtap="readLoginDocument">《隐私政策》</button></view><button class="check-row login-consent-check" role="checkbox" aria-checked="{{consentChecked}}" bindtap="toggleConsent"><text class="checkbox {{consentChecked?'selected':''}}">{{consentChecked?'✓':''}}</text>我已阅读并同意以上协议</button><text wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</text><view class="login-consent-actions"><button class="outline" bindtap="closeLoginConsent">暂不登录</button><button class="solid" disabled="{{!consentChecked}}" bindtap="confirmLoginConsent">同意并登录</button></view></block>
 </view>
</view>
